"client and server during the TLS handshake to negotiate which protocol they "
"will use for communication. ALPN enables more efficient communication by "
"allowing the client to indicate its preferred application protocol to the "
"server before the TLS connection is established. This helps in scenarios "
"such as HTTP/2 where multiple protocols may be available, allowing for "
"faster protocol selection."
msgstr ""

