msgid "Working with OpenShift serving certificates"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When running your application in OpenShift, you can use the link:https://"
"docs.openshift.com/container-platform/4.16/security/certificates/service-"
"serving-certificate.html[OpenShift serving certificates] to generate and "
"renew TLS certificates automatically.\n"
"The Quarkus TLS registry can use these certificates and Certificate "
"Authority (CA) files to handle HTTPS traffic and validate certificates "
"securely."
