msgid "<<acquiring-a-certificate>>"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Now that your service uses a certificate issued by OpenShift, configure your "
"client applications to trust this certificate.\n"
"To do so, create a ConfigMap that holds the CA certificate, and then "
"configure the pod to mount it.\n"
"The following steps use a Quarkus REST client as an example, but the same "
