msgid "Renewing a certificate"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Renewing certificates is similar to issuing the first certificate, but it "
"requires an existing account created during the <<lets-encrypt-issue-"
"certificate,Issue certificates with Let's Encrypt>> step."
msgstr ""

